  "packageHash": "YmKmVCAQRZfqoZtH4Z/q+aGeDGtG6eEPpH2uLTkfTYBylBRdhGqCddeuKm/kmbaNhOWav6SxyAzenCzbKuTDfg==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 243709,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/Cynicszm/FlatFiles",
  "published": "2026-09-22T17:17:02.197Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking. TimeSpanColumn.FromMillseconds is renamed FromMilliseconds. QuoteBehavior becomes QuoteBehaviour, OptimizeMapping becomes OptimiseMapping and its isOptimized parameter becomes isOptimised. The obsolete Preprocessor members are removed from IColumnDefinition, ColumnDefinition and all twenty-six property mapping interfaces; OnParsing replaces them. A delimited record is now parsed straight from the parser's buffer, which makes IRecordContext.Values report the record being processed and null once the reader has moved on; the fixed-length reader narrows to match. That last one changes no signature, so nothing will warn you about it. A delimited read allocates 741 bytes a record where 7.6.0 allocated 1,171.",
